  "title": "Cintas Corporation Announces Fiscal 2026 Third Quarter Results",
  "summary": "Cintas Corporation today reported results for its fiscal 2026 third quarter ended February 28, 2026. Revenue for the third quarter of fiscal 2026 was $2.84 billion compared to $2.61 billion in last year’s third quarter, an increase of 8.9%.",
